          "type": "prose",
          "role": "mechanism",
          "text": "Use print(label, value) for a labeled view of the state at an execution point. Observe the text before conversion and the quantity after its binding rather than guessing from a final result.",
          "lineage": {
            "concept_ids": [
              "python.diagnostic_printing"
